@startuml refresh-activity
!include _theme.puml
' Worker stages; a completed refresh parent does not mean every vector is ready.
start
:Claim refresh; fetch changed listings or full feeds;
:Drop incomplete listings; deduplicate, screen and limit admissions;
:Commit job rows and any child indexing work\ntogether; checkpoint the parent refresh;
if (Child items queued?) then (no)
  stop
else (yes)
  :Claim batch; compute or reuse vectors; upsert to Chroma;
endif
if (Stored content hash matches?) then (yes)
  :Complete the item\nunder its lease;
else (no)
  :Record retry or failure;\ndo not mark complete;
endif
stop
@enduml
